# Documentation files (not needed in container)
README.md
APIDOC.md
USAGE.md
docs/
# ...except the LLM gateway's config, which `apps/rag/Dockerfile` copies into the
# image. The file lives under `docs/` because it is documentation of the provider
# chain as much as configuration of it, and a negation here is cheaper than
# moving it and breaking every link that points at it. Without this line the RAG
# image cannot build: buildkit warns `CopyIgnoredFile` and then fails on the
# missing path.
!docs/rag/
!docs/rag/gateway.yaml
*.md

